  "project_description": "Back to top \n\n Description \n This module allows logging email messages sent by Mailer Plus .\n\nBoth versions 1.6.x and 2.0.x of the Mailer Plus module are supported.\n\nThey are stored as Drupal content entities.\n\n Back to top \n\n Configuration \n \n Install and enable this module \n Go to the policy settings page of Mailer Plus (/admin/config/system/mailer) \n Edit the policy for which you wish to log emails (could be a specific mail, or the `*All*` policy). Add the \"Log email\" element to your policy. \n Back to top",
